        <item>
            <title>0.5.65</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 05:13:55 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/chenlaiyi/TapgoAICoding/releases/tag/v0.5.65</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.5.65</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.65</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Tapgo AICoding 0.5.65

- 真机复验 v0.5.64 后的收口修正：贴边窗口下手柄拖拽阈值从 6pt 降到 3pt（窗口最外侧数 pt 是系统缩放边框，手柄中部起拖最多只有约 5pt 位移，6pt 阈值仍会漏）。
- 修复拖宽自动弹出的步进误判：分隔条拖动以每步 3–5pt 的连续小步到达阈值，单步增量判定永远不满足；改为只要宿主窗口宽度未变（说明宽度变化来自分隔条拖动而非窗口缩放）且工作台宽度达到 560pt 即自动弹出环境抽屉。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/chenlaiyi/TapgoAICoding/releases/download/v0.5.65/Tapgo-AICoding-0.5.65.zip" length="9422811" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="dbulHu8gttAtMNGbVuFSBtOo3WXfhVeh++JLjG4/ECt8OEHs1wYw6X1oLPWmM9sTrzCCs4WRcl3rYNNfrc1PAg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.5.64</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 05:04:45 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/chenlaiyi/TapgoAICoding/releases/tag/v0.5.64</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.5.64</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.64</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Tapgo AICoding 0.5.64

- 修复右缘拖拽展开环境信息在全屏宽窗口下失效的问题：窗口贴住屏幕右缘时向右位移不足 24pt 阈值，手势永远无法触发；现在点击手柄或小位移向右拖拽（>6pt）即可展开。
- 新增 ZCode 式"拖宽自动弹出"：把主会话与工作台之间的分隔条向右拖、工作台宽度达到 560pt 时环境信息抽屉自动弹出；仅分隔条拖动触发（窗口整体拉宽不触发），并带防回弹闩锁，手动关闭后工作台收窄到 500pt 以内才重新武装。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/chenlaiyi/TapgoAICoding/releases/download/v0.5.64/Tapgo-AICoding-0.5.64.zip" length="9422439" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="J0iSPyCCDyK4QAi45lNMTxmUUNW9wPZ6lcME9tUGMrU4ZMKhEiEturQ8f0jEV3G79Ba+uyx7UaUHvy/jNHLPAg=="/>
